<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1361393" n="1"/>
  <opener>
      <lb/>Viro <abbr>Ill.<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></abbr> et <abbr>Celeber.<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></abbr> <abbr>D.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolao Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Petrus Antonius Michelotti</rs>
  </opener>
  <p>
      <lb/>Hanc, quam accepi a <rs type="person">Patruele</rs> Tuo <rs type="lostletter">epistolam</rs><note type="editorial">Das beigelegte Schreiben eines Vetters an Nicolaus I ist bislang nur indirekt bezeugt; ein genaues Datum wird hier nicht genannt.</note>
      <lb/>ad Te transmitto, eodemque tempore significo
      <lb/>me <subst><del>d</del><add>T</add></subst>uas <rs key="B_991170517037205501" type="letter">litteras</rs> accepisse ante aliquot dies.
      <lb/>Gaudeo quod meditaris proximis vacationi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>bus opus aliquod<note type="comment">Siehe dazu die Fussnote im vorhergehenden Brief.</note> edere ad <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stimationem
      <lb/>Tui nominis augendam peritis, atque
      <lb/>ad imperitor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> arroganti<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> compescendam.
      <lb/>Libenter Te amplectar h<choice><orig><g ref="#ihat">î</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice>c Domi me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Vir
      <lb/><abbr>Amiciss.<hi rend="sup">e</hi></abbr> postremis ba<unclear>c</unclear>analior<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> diebus.
  </p>
  <closer>In<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>terim vale et me amare perge. <dateline>Dabam
      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs>
      <date when="1718-02-14" when-custom="1717-02-14" calendar="#moreveneto">
        <abbr>a. d.</abbr> 14 Febr.<hi rend="sup">ii</hi> <formula>\frac{1717\, \mathrm{m.\;v.}}{1718\, \mathrm{m.\;I.}}</formula>
      </date><note type="editorial">Michelotti nennt beide Jahreszählungen: Der 14. Februar 1717 <hi rend="i">more veneto</hi> entspricht dem 14. Februar 1718 <hi rend="i">more Imperii</hi>, da das venezianische Jahr am 1. März begann.</note></dateline>
      <lb/>
    <note hand="pers_DE-588-119166895">
                            <foreign xml:lang="ger">
                                <abbr>Empf.</abbr> den <date when="1718-02-15">15<hi rend="sup">ten</hi>
                                </date>.</foreign>
                        </note>
  </closer>
<pb facs="1361394" n="2" type="empty"/>
</div>
